cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Entropy diagnostics of coverage imbalance and reweighting in archaeological predictive modelling"
version: "1.1"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data for an information-theoretic diagnostic of coverage
  imbalance in archaeological predictive modelling, a heuristic entropy
  weight compared with standard weighting schemes, and a comparison of four predictive frameworks under
  random and spatially blocked cross-validation.
type: software
license: MIT
